==History==
2024
*The Giant Snowball's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 2/12/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/12/2024)|December 2024 Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], fixed various bugs with the Evolved Giant Snowball {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Giant Snowball's rolling distance to 4.5 tiles (from 4 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Giant Snowball's slow duration to 4 seconds (from 3 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Evolved Giant Snowball's rolling speed to 300 (from 200) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] decreased the slowdown effect to -30% (from -35%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2026

* On 4/5/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Giant Snowball's slow duration to 3 seconds (from 4 seconds)
* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Giant Snowball's [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 25% of the full damage (from 30%)
* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Giant Snowball's projectile range to 4 tiles (from 4.5 tiles)

