==Trivia== 
*The Giant Snowball is 1 of 2 evolved [[cards]] associated with ice, with the other being [[Ice Spirit/Evolution|Ice Spirit]].
** In the German, Spanish, Dutch, and Portuguese language settings of the game, the Giant Snowball's name translates to "Snowball". In the Arabic and Finnish language settings of the game, the Giant Snowball's name translates to "Giant Snow Globe". In the Chinese and Persian language settings of the game, the Giant Snowball's name translates to "Big Snowball". In the French and Norwegian language settings of the game, the Giant Snowball's name translates to "Mega Snowball" and "Huge Snowball" respectively.
*The Giant Snowball is the only evolved card whose regular card does not have a card render.
*The Giant Snowball's Evolution is 1 of 3 evolved cards without the diamond evolution symbol anywhere on their card render, the others being [[Bats/Evolution|Bats]] and [[Ice Spirit/Evolution|Ice Spirit]].
*The Giant Snowball's Evolution is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
**It is also 1 of 4 evolved cards whose regular card is not the subject of any Emote, the others being [[Royal Recruits/Evolution|Royal Recruits]], [[Zap/Evolution|Zap]], and [[Battle Ram/Evolution|Battle Ram]].

